{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You are James Anderson, and you've come to the place where your father went missing on the anniversary of his disappearance. When your father built an amusement park, he never imagined that so much joy and happiness would end up feeding something sinister.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Now you're back, in the very same place, and if you're brave enough, you're about to find out what happened\u2014not just to him.</strong> <strong>His fate won't let you sleep at night. Are you ready to get your last ticket and\u00a0step\u00a0inside?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/Atmospheric_Exploration.png?t=1749474674\" />Explore the environment in eerie silence. Beware how and where you look, who knows what you may find in your way. The terror is in psychology, not the violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/gif_exploration.gif?t=1749474674\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/Twisted_Geometry.png?t=1749474674\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get lost, find the right path, and then get lost again. Not every hallway makes sense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/gif_non_euclidian.gif?t=1749474674\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/Liminal_Elements.png?t=1749474674\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some areas may seem familiar, but somehow wrong. Never fully real, but never fully fake either.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/GIF_Liminal.gif?t=1749474674\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/Interactive_Rides.png?t=1749474674\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rides and attractions may seem fun, but\u2026 Nevermind, why spoiling it? Just don\u2019t get too relaxed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/GIF_Ride.gif?t=1749474674\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Liminal intersects cosmic: The game takes place in an odd environment that blends liminal and cosmic features.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story-driven game: A twist-filled adventure with cosmic horror themes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exploration-driven gameplay: Exploring an abandoned park and underground areas, following clues and building a narrative is central to this game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interactive attractions and rides: Broken rides and attractions inexplicably remain operational, inviting players to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Psychological unease: Narrative in Emotionless: The Last Ticket confuses players, with environmental storytelling and liminal spaces intensifying feelings\u00a0of\u00a0isolation.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3570000?t=1749474674","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/1d094d0d1c331a6e6e0454bdf84733c838a6bb18/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749474674","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/6cabd5c5a7eaa74d5e459bd72ea3edc6ae4fe78c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749474674","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/6cabd5c5a7eaa74d5e459bd72ea3edc6ae4fe78c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749474674","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3777250,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>New Trailer Alert!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More mysteries, more chills. Watch the trailer and wishlist now on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/Special_Capsule.png?t=1749474674\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You are James Anderson, and you've come to the place where your father went missing on the anniversary of his disappearance. When your father built an amusement park, he never imagined that so much joy and happiness would end up feeding something sinister.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Now you're back, in the very same place, and if you're brave enough, you're about to find out what happened\u2014not just to him.</strong> <strong>His fate won't let you sleep at night. Are you ready to get your last ticket and\u00a0step\u00a0inside?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/Atmospheric_Exploration.png?t=1749474674\" />Explore the environment in eerie silence. Beware how and where you look, who knows what you may find in your way. The terror is in psychology, not the violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/gif_exploration.gif?t=1749474674\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/Twisted_Geometry.png?t=1749474674\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get lost, find the right path, and then get lost again. Not every hallway makes sense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/gif_non_euclidian.gif?t=1749474674\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/Liminal_Elements.png?t=1749474674\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some areas may seem familiar, but somehow wrong. Never fully real, but never fully fake either.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/GIF_Liminal.gif?t=1749474674\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/Interactive_Rides.png?t=1749474674\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rides and attractions may seem fun, but\u2026 Nevermind, why spoiling it? Just don\u2019t get too relaxed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/GIF_Ride.gif?t=1749474674\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Liminal intersects cosmic: The game takes place in an odd environment that blends liminal and cosmic features.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story-driven game: A twist-filled adventure with cosmic horror themes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exploration-driven gameplay: Exploring an abandoned park and underground areas, following clues and building a narrative is central to this game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interactive attractions and rides: Broken rides and attractions inexplicably remain operational, inviting players to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Psychological unease: Narrative in Emotionless: The Last Ticket confuses players, with environmental storytelling and liminal spaces intensifying feelings\u00a0of\u00a0isolation.</p></li></ul>","developers":["X1 Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/70290b0c99fb3b209ad2414e41af625dd02de50d/header.jpg?t=1749474674","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257152245,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152245/movie480.mp4?t=1749215019","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152245/movie_max.mp4?t=1749215019"},"name":"Demo Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257152245/7895eebf67de72a64979f6e6c888f708961dbf2e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749215019","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152245/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749215019","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152245/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749215019"}}],"name":"EMOTIONLESS : The Last Ticket","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or higher<br></li><li